|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|that value                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i45 : ptsStratRational.ExtendField --look at our changed value               |
|                                                                             |
|o45 = false                                                                  |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i46 : time dim (J + chooseGoodMinors(1, 6, M, J, Strategy=>Points,           |
| -- used 0.652403s (cpu); 0.580255s (thread); 0s (gc)                        |
|                                                                             |
|o46 = 2                                                                      |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|PointOptions=>ptsStratRational))                                             |
